Auditor Note: Very rarely do you get a "clean" audit. Findings are normal. Our job in GRC is to manage the findings, determine the root cause, and implement a Corrective and Preventive Action (CAPA).
Finding ID: DEL-2023-01 Control ID Failed: AC-02 (Terminated User Revocation) Description of Finding: During the review of Q2 terminations, auditors sampled 15 departed employees. 3 out of 15 employees did not have their Azure and GitHub access revoked within the required 24-hour SLA. Access remained active for an average of 9 days post-termination. Risk / Impact: Unauthorized access to source code and production environments by former employees, potentially leading to data exfiltration or malicious disruption. Severity: High (Major Exception) Root Cause: HR processed the terminations in their payroll system but forgot to manually generate a ServiceNow offboarding ticket for the IT department.
